==Strategy==
As the first stage and arguably hardest stage in [[Weak & Mildly Acidic]], this is an extreme endurance and pushing stage not dissimilar to the previous subchapter's [[Gestalt, Decay]]. Many powerful pushing units will come at you in waves based on their trait.

Generalist midrangers such as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] or [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] are highly recommnded. [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] and [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] are especially useful against their respective target traits while also helping against the other enemies to some degree as generalist attackers. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] works great here as a nuker due to his good range and damage, ensuring anything he hits will take immense damage or outright die then and there.

Bring strong generalist meatshields such as [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Wall Cat]] or [[Pogo Cat (Rare Cat)|Jiangshi Cat]], alongside [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] to cease any of Elizabeth's Wave Attacks. A reliable critter such as [[Jurassic Cat (Rare Cat)|Catasaurus]] or [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cheerleader Cat]] is essential to get rid of the Metal One Horn.

